<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Apple lowered to reduce.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Apple lowered to reduce.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards said it had lowered its rating on Apple Computer Inc to reduce from maintain.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed 2-1/4 lower to 24-9/16.</p>
</text>
